{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- New Commerce Split (The \"Company\") declares a monthly distribution of $0.07500 per share for Capital shareholders (YCM), and its regular monthly distribution of $0.02500 per share ($0.30 annually) for Class I Preferred shareholders (YCM.PR.A), and $0.0312…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- New Commerce Split (The \"Company\") declares a monthly distribution of $0.07500 per share for Capital shareholders (YCM), and its regular monthly distribution of $0.02500 per share ($0.30 annually) for Class I Preferred shareholders (YCM.PR.A), and $0.03125 per share ($0.375 annually) for Class II Preferred shareholders (YCM.PR.B). The Class I Preferreds are paid at an annual rate of 6.00% based on their $5 repayment amount. Class II Preferreds are paid at an annual rate of 7.50% based on their $5 repayment amount. Distributions are payable October 9, 2026 to shareholders on record as at September 30, 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company invests in common shares of Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, a Canadian financial institution."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Distribution Details "]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Capital Share (YCM) "]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["$0.07500 "]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Class I Preferred Share (YCM.PR.A) "]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["$0.02500 "]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":